# Keep build contexts small and free of secrets and local build output.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
apps/api/src/generated
apps/api/var
apps/ai/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
deploy/terraform/**/.terraform
deploy/terraform/**/*.tfstate*
